","updated_at":"2026-05-13T09:38:32+08:00","user":{"id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","login":"cheng_gao","object_id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","name":"cheng_gao","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fd/9e5764f6f90dfc75b8bf7ff56a0eaf70df5db7c39e556d88264f7dce536ad86d.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cheng_gao"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":171200195,"discussion_id":"0483c85292a5511984eb2dcc9ab713075a0db397","body":"原先 SetRunInfoToV2 里用 IsSocVersionFuse 分支，只有 fuse 场景走 GetFusionMode、非 fuse 走 GetImplMode，所以属性下标 7 在 fuse 下按 int32 fusion、在非 fuse 下按 bool 的 enable_hf32，两种语义不会同时生效。\n\n现在 GetFusionMode 只要 opType 是 kExtendConvTranspose 就会去读下标 7 的 fusion，而且没有 IsSocVersionFuse 条件；GetImplMode 又对 kExtendConvTranspose 直接 return，不再读 enable_hf32。\n\n在非 fuse、FP32、且 attr 仍带下标 7 的 Extend 场景里，可能用 int32 去读本应是 bool 的槽位，同时 hf32 会一直是默认 0。\n\n建议在 GetFusionMode 里恢复与 IsSocVersionFuse 的组合判断（或等价拆分支），并让非 fuse 的 Extend 仍按与 Conv3DTransposeV2 相同的方式读取 enable_hf32，或从 Extend 专用下标读并注明和图上的约定一致。","created_at":"2026-05-13T09:39:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-05-13T09:43:56+08:00","user":{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","object_id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","login":"cheng_gao","object_id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","name":"cheng_gao","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fd/9e5764f6f90dfc75b8bf7ff56a0eaf70df5db7c39e556d88264f7dce536ad86d.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cheng_gao"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1496,"end_new_line":1496,"start_old_line":1496,"end_old_line":1496,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":171201149,"body":"经确认，非问题。本次就是要修改逻辑，因为在非fuse场景要增加ExtendConvTranspose调用。为了优化代码，原有按是否fuse决定走GetFusionMode还是GetImplMode不合理，所以改为是否按算子OPTYPE决定走GetFusionMode还是GetImplMode更合理。","created_at":"2026-05-13T09:43:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-05-13T09:44:44+08:00","user":{"id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","login":"cheng_gao","object_id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","name":"cheng_gao","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fd/9e5764f6f90dfc75b8bf7ff56a0eaf70df5db7c39e556d88264f7dce536ad86d.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cheng_gao"}}]},{"id":171200204,"discussion_id":"5e70c454fce5381e8d0429f37dc0c7224f788460","body":"以前在 SoC fuse 下，kConv3DTransposeV2 会进 GetFusionMode 从属性里写 enRelu。\n\n现在 GetFusionMode 只在 kExtendConvTranspose 时读 fusion，标准 kConv3DTransposeV2 在 fuse 下不会再更新 enRelu；SetRunInfoToV2 又改成总是先 GetFusionMode 再 GetImplMode，fuse 下的标准 transpose 会多走 hf32 分支。\n\n若产品上还有原生 Conv3DTransposeV2 的量化融合 Relu 路径，需要确认是否已下线或补回归用例，避免 silent 行为变化。","created_at":"2026-05-13T09:39:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-05-13T09:46:42+08:00","user":{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","object_id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","login":"cheng_gao","object_id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","name":"cheng_gao","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fd/9e5764f6f90dfc75b8bf7ff56a0eaf70df5db7c39e556d88264f7dce536ad86d.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cheng_gao"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":1951,"end_new_line":1951,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":171201776,"body":"经确认，非问题。问题同上，本次pr就是为了优化逻辑，根据算子optype来决定读取参数对应不同的功能，而不是根据芯片类型。","created_at":"2026-05-13T09:46:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-05-13T09:46:42+08:00","user":{"id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","login":"cheng_gao","object_id":"6776820d8aed3e230a2ea943","name":"cheng_gao","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fd/9e5764f6f90dfc75b8bf7ff56a0eaf70df5db7c39e556d88264f7dce536ad86d.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cheng_gao"}}]},{"id":171205318,"discussion_id":"3ad7c50573541d0c9cdc3db0c75555da9c3d63ff","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-05-13T10:01:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:01:34+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"c